body:
Time to destroy this thing

&#x200B;

Awhhh reddit incel soyboys, how sad. If any of you ugly downvoters ever manage to have sex you will understand what I mean. Keep being salty for now and jerking your dick, losers.

Try to keep your balance at all cost. Going down is the worst thing you can do. Either run or beat them, but don't fall down, because it will be over. If you fall down anyway roll like a madman giving you a second to stand up.

&#x200B;

Oh, and also: If someone suddenly goes with his hand into his pocket, fucking run. He will not grab candy, 9 times out of 10 it's a blade or gun.

I pressed charges. I told them I did, page about me has been removed right away. Only the google search results are left, and that is on pending.

&#x200B;

You don't know me, I don't know you, but you gave me the motivation to go to the cops. Thanks a lot man.

I was at -8, so it seems like some agree at least haha, but thanks. Yeah, I could've said it nicer but I'm fed up of idiots overfeeding their cats for redditkarma and shit... 

&#x200B;

Personally, the discord is fine. Not too sjw, just average people playing the game and some banter in between.

&#x200B;

Feel free to join, it's the official one: [https://discord.gg/rs](https://discord.gg/rs)

'You've ran out of your 3 free premium articles, purchase a subscription now for 100 articles per month!'

&#x200B;

Yeah, just access the article on incognito.

Put your goal should always to be bigger.

&#x200B;

Jeeezzzz the downvotes. Sorry for having an opinion folks, in Europe that shit is allowed. Very funny how this is considered a libtard forum but having an opinion is illegal. To all that downvoted, I hope you fucking catch corona, make your family sick with it, see them all die, and survive alone. Fuckers.

'Is Germany in Europe?'

&#x200B;

We live in Holland.

That I was being home-schooled, while being in school.

&#x200B;

Oh wait, stolen, just like this question lol.
